<title>SRI LANKA: Port conditions update - SRI LANKA - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - SRI LANKA - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>SRI LANKA, Oct 1 - Colombo  -- Eight container dischargers/loaders, two food dischargers, two general cargo dischargers, two cement dischargers and five breakbulk loaders presently working. Two container vessels, three breakbulk dischargers awaiting berths.</p>
</text>
